    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>RGNMHN Customer Wishlist adds a clean “Save to Wishlist” button on WooCommerce product pages. Built for performance and flexibility, it allows your customers to save products for later, boosting engagement and conversions.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to <code>/wp-content/plugins/rgnmhn-customer-wishlist/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate through <strong>Plugins &gt; Installed Plugins</strong> in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Configure settings in the dashboard lower part.</li>\n<li>(Optional) Use <code>[rgnmhn_customer_wishlist_single_product]</code> shortcode to place the button.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='does%20it%20work%20with%20variable%20products%3F'>\nDoes it work with variable products?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, variable products are supported and can be saved to the wishlist.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20it%20translation-ready%3F'>\nIs it translation-ready?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You can use tools like Loco Translate to add your own translations.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Adds a lightweight “Save to Wishlist” button on WooCommerce products, helping customers save items for later.",
    "description": "<p>RGNMHN Customer Wishlist adds a clean “Save to Wishlist” button on WooCommerce product pages. Built for performance and flexibility, it allows your customers to save products for later, boosting engagement and conversions.</p>\n",
